WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.920
Life originates in the soul, which exists in solid and loose forms.

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:07.260
Stronger beings have their souls held together in unicity,

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.060
infusing their unique personality and power.

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:13.880
When the body is broken, the link to these souls is severed,

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.120
exposing the solid soul to the air.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.460
When exposed, souls burn like they're on fire.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.120
It make sence then, that the four Lord Souls were found within the First Flame.

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:25.220
They were the fuel.

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:27.880
But if the soul is the source of all life,

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:31.300
then what distinguishes the humanity we hold within ourselves?

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.480
The truth is, even humanity originates from the soul.

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:36.840
It's simply a fragment of the Dark Soul.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:41.160
The mysteries of souls, crystals and sorceries are deeply intertwined.

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:44.340
The more you understand these things, the more control you have over them.

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:48.280
Soul sorcery is the art of controlling soul power with knowledge.

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:51.120
Just like we manipulate fire with heart and instinct,

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:52.820
and miracles though faith.

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:57.060
The Dragon School of Vinheim teaches and researches sorcery.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:59.700
The great hero of Vinheim is Big Hat Logan,

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:02.260
a great sorcerer and teacher to many students.

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:05.600
In time however, he tired from the attention of others,

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:07.740
and donned a large hat to hide his face,

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:09.340
earning him his nickname.

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:12.980
Locked away in a cage in Sen's Fortress,

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:15.060
we first encounter Big Hat Logan.

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:19.880
"I have a bright idea. Suppose you set me free?

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:21.680
I'm old and empty-handed,

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:24.540
but I could repay you with knowledge, and sorcery.

00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:27.100
This place is melting my mind.

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:30.220
The inactivity is repressive!

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:32.200
I'm saved.

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:34.120
And, I'd love to resume my travels,

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:38.120
but I must log a few things first, and I owe you a favor."

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:41.500
Back at Firelink Shrine Logan treats you like an equal,

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.700
and offers to teach you all that he knows.

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:45.460
"Glad to see you alive.

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:48.540
As promised, I will share my sorceries.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:50.960
You really are very diligent."

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:54.440
On your journey you'll find another sorcerer from Vinheim.

00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:59.000
Once rescued, Griggs joins you at Firelink Shrine as another sorcerer whose in your debt.

00:01:59.620 --> 00:02:01.740
On the topic of Logan he says this.

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:03.520
"He is a true hero.

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:05.780
No, the reason I seek Logan is…

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:09.160
…well, it's really my own conceit, now isn't it?"

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:13.100
This sorcerer of Vinheim seeks Logan simply to prove that he can.

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:16.300
It's clear that he admires the man and strives to be like him.

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:21.100
After you've proven your word as a student and learned everything that Logan has to teach,

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:23.360
Logan mentions that he has plans to leave.

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:25.620
As to where, that's unknown.

00:02:26.060 --> 00:02:27.260
"Heading out are you?

00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:29.080
I, too, will leave soon.

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:32.420
Undead or no, I shan't stay here forever.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:33.980
You have great potential.

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:37.320
Don't go and die over nothing."

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:40.820
With his debt repaid, Logan leaves Firelink.

00:02:41.120 --> 00:02:45.020
He tells you his plans, but he doesn't tell Griggs, who is left in a dark again.

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:46.320
"Oh, there you are!

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:47.920
Just so you know…

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:50.180
Master Logan has left on his own again.

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:54.640
It seems that he is still determined to find the famed Regal Archives in Anor Londo.

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:56.460
I intend to search for him."

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:59.560
And this is the last you'll ever hear of Griggs.

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:01.900
Hope that you never see him again.

00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:06.100
Sorcery in enhanced by understanding and knowledge.

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:08.160
That's why Logan seeks the Archives,

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:12.960
a place built for Seath the Scaleless as reward for his help against the everlasting dragons.

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:15.520
The knowledge contained there is beyond measure.

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:17.860
Seath was born different from his brothers,

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:20.480
who were encased in stone scales that made them immortal.

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:21.960
Seath was a mutation,

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:25.740
an albino dragon who didn't have the immortality his brothers possessed.

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:28.780
Driven by jealousy, he betrayed their secrets.

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:31.120
And soon after driven by desperation,

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:33.300
he began the search for immortality.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:36.780
Seath created six-eyed channelers to be his eyes,

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:39.440
scouring the archives and other lands for knowledge.

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:43.700
He created crystal golems to retrieve trinkets and maidens for his experiments.

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:46.560
He does all this knowing the time is running out.

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:49.700
Logan once taught you that life originates in the soul,

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:52.740
that why a crystal homing soulmass draws towards it.

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:55.640
Somehow crystals are linked to the soul

00:03:55.920 --> 00:04:00.400
and so through the power of crystals Seath finally finds what he's been lookin for.

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:02.520
"Ah...

00:04:03.480 --> 00:04:05.920
The secret of Seath's immortality?

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.100
If you have fought him, and were imprisoned,

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:12.340
you must know that Seath is a true Undead,

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:14.160
different from ourselves.

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:16.760
His wounds close promptly

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:19.060
and no mortal blow affects him,

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:21.720
granting true insulation from death.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:25.180
It is an effect of the Primordial Crystal,

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:30.020
a sacred treasure pillaged by Seath when he turned upon the ancient dragons.

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:32.040
So, only by destroying

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:33.760
the Primordial Crystal

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:37.560
can you so much as scratch his hide."

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:39.700
Seath's knowledge comes at a price,

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:42.580
he finds a source of immortality and hides it away,

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:44.040
but something changes.

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:45.640
The other lords notice.

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:50.360
Seath locks himself away in his archives and stations two armored boars in the hallways.

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:54.320
Channelers guard the stairways and the crystal hollows are scattered throughout.

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:59.700
On top of all that the Archives now lead anyone strong enough to a chamber with a Seath himself inside.

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:02.920
Upon your death Seath lock you in a cell with a bonfire,

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:05.960
knowing that you'll be locked into a cycle within that cell.

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:08.420
It's almost like he knew you were coming.

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:11.300
But you escape and roam the archives freely.

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:13.520
This is where you encounter Logan again.

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:15.680
But he's not the same.

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:18.980
"Oh, there you are,

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:20.660
it's been a while.

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:21.560
Or...

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.880
...were you just here?

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:27.880
This fascinating place defeats my sense of time…"

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:40.420
The same knowledge that unsettled Seath is affecting Logan.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:44.700
There's some things in the Archives that should remain unknown.

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:47.200
For the path to true knowledge is cursed,

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:51.140
and the fate of the three sorcerers in Lordran is something that should be forgotten.

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:53.880
The less that is known, the better.

